WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet slightly wider than hips, toes turned out comfortably.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the knees deeply and lower the hips all the way down between the ankles.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Bring the palms together at the heart and press the elbows gently into the inner knees.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lengthen the crown upward and let the tailbone release toward the floor.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the heels grounding - onto a blanket if they hover.
